 R←TestLoad;names;missing
⍝ The modern namespace loads and reaches the shared data tables through Data
⍝ Data is a reference to the book namespace; data tables are not copied
 R←1
 :If 9≠⎕NC'##.Data'
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestLoad: Starmap.Data is not a namespace reference'
     R←0 ⋄ :Return
 :EndIf
 names←'STARS' 'STARNAMES' 'STARCONSTELLATION' 'CONSTELLATIONS' 'BRIGHT' 'BP'
 names,←'planets' 'moon' 'kohoutek' 'PLANETNAMES' 'reference_positions'
 names,←'AXITILT' 'CATEPOCH' 'EQUINOX' 'MOONRATIO' 'TROPYR' 'YRLENGTH'
 missing←names/⍨0=##.Data.⎕NC names
 :If 0≠≢missing
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestLoad: missing from Data: ',⍕missing
     R←0
 :EndIf
 :If 332 2≢⍴##.Data.STARS
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestLoad: Data.STARS shape ',⍕⍴##.Data.STARS
     R←0
 :EndIf
 :If 9 11≢⍴##.Data.planets
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestLoad: Data.planets shape ',⍕⍴##.Data.planets
     R←0
 :EndIf
 :If 0≠≢names∩##.⎕NL ¯2 ¯3
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestLoad: data tables copied into Starmap: ',⍕names∩##.⎕NL ¯2 ¯3
     R←0
 :EndIf
 :If R
     ⎕←'PASS: TestLoad (',(⍕≢names),' shared data tables)'
 :EndIf
